{"id":"n2-169","title":"～を問わず","romaji":"〜wo towazu","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Means 'regardless of' or 'irrespective of'.","longExplanation":"「～を問わず」 is used to express that something applies or is available without any distinction regarding the stated nouns/conditions. It means 'regardless of...' or 'irrespective of...'.","formation":"Noun + を問わず","examples":[{"jp":"このイベントは、年齢を問わず、誰でも参加できます。","romaji":"Kono ibento wa, nenrei o towazu, dare demo sanka dekimasu.","en":"This event is open to everyone, regardless of age.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"イベント","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"年齢","vocabId":"1600240","reading":"ねんれい"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"問わず","vocabId":"2027030","reading":"とわず"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"誰でも","vocabId":"1416850","reading":"だれでも"},{"surface":"参加","vocabId":"1302090","reading":"さんか"},{"surface":"でき","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"できる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6]},{"jp":"このスーパーは、日曜日を問わず、毎日開いています。","romaji":"Kono suupaa wa, nichiyoubi o towazu, mainichi aite imasu.","en":"This supermarket is open every day, regardless of Sunday.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"スーパー","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"日曜日","vocabId":"1464900","reading":"にちようび"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"問わず","vocabId":"2027030","reading":"とわず"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"毎日","vocabId":"1524720","reading":"まいにち"},{"surface":"開いています","vocabId":"1202440","reading":"ひらいています","baseForm":"開く"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6]},{"jp":"彼女は、暑さ寒さを問わず、毎朝散歩をしています。","romaji":"Kanojo wa, atsusa samusa o towazu, maiasa sanpo o shite imasu.","en":"She takes a walk every morning, no matter the heat or cold.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"sur